				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5e9421c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5e9421c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Horti-Links International was launched in November 2000 by a group of six graduates from the University of Agriculture Faisalabad.</p><p>Since our establishment in 2001, we have grown to become a comprehensive provider of horticultural plants, landscaping solutions, and a wide range of related products and services.</p><p>Our mission is to strive for a green world by enhancing landscapes and contributing to a healthier environment through beautification, pollution control, and aesthetic value.</p>								</div>
				</div>
